      "excerpt": "Discover powers during your trial that change your Arcana (and your play) in unexpected ways. Mix, match, experiment, and master your favorite combinations…until you find a new favorite on your next run. Command the raw aspects of fire, water, earth, lightning, air, and chaos.",
