    },
    {
      "text": "最多四名法师在线组队，把不同奥术同时释放成更混乱的协同战斗",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Prepare to face an all-new series of unpredictably perilous trials in Wizard of Legend 2—the action-packed follow-up to the acclaimed dungeon-delving original, featuring vibrant new 3D visuals and fast-paced 4-player online co-op.",
